// OPTIONAL — you normally don't need this file.
//
// The simplest way to sign: in Xcode, select the DeckCheck target → Signing &
// Capabilities → Automatically manage signing → pick your Team (a free Apple ID works,
// no raw Team ID required). You must pick a Team in Xcode either way, so it can
// provision your device.
//
// This file only helps if you'll commit a fork and want to keep your Team ID OUT of git:
// copy it to `Local.xcconfig` (same folder — git-ignored) and set the ID below.
//
// To find your 10-character Team ID if you want it here, run in Terminal:
//     security find-identity -v -p codesigning
// It's the code in parentheses after your name on an "Apple Development" identity.
// (Paid accounts can also read it at developer.apple.com → Membership.)
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOUR_TEAM_ID
